{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_318","type":"agent_message","text":"Implemented E01 (TF-0274) in the workspace.\n\n**What Changed**\n- `scripts/lib/reliability-aggregation.mjs` + `.d.mts`: pure, deterministic aggregator. `pass^k` (all k trials) and `pass@k` (≥1 trial) are separate fields; `flake` requires first-trial failure then all-pass reruns and keeps the first failure; missing/timeout/crash/skip/cancel become `incomplete` and are excluded from every denominator but retained with per-reason detail; positive/negative anchors and safety cases (0 skip / 0 flake) gate hard; fewer than `minCases` yields `insufficient-sample`, never PASS.\n- `shared/agent-dev/reliability-fixture.json`: pre-registered `k=3`, `minCases=20`, 1% non-safety flake budget, 29 cases across the existing scenario registry, and 6 counter-examples.\n- `scripts/agent-dev-benefit-eval.mjs`: adds a `reliability` block plus a Markdown section to the existing benefit report, and re-evaluates every counter-example to prove the gate can fail.\n- `tests/unit/agent-dev-reliability-aggregation.test.ts`: 123 assertions covering metric separation, incomplete handling, flake, anchors, sample-size, determinism and counter-examples.\n- `harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-reliability-aggregation.md`, `harness/specs/rules/reliability-aggregation-boundary.md`, `docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/e01-reliability-aggregation.md`, `e01-acceptance.json`, `E01-SHA256SUMS`.\n- `scripts/repository-artifacts.json` + `.gitignore`: register the three new curated evidence files as retained inputs.\n\n**Checks Run**\n- `node scripts/agent-dev-benefit-eval.mjs` → exit 0; `gate=pass`, `pass^k=1`, `pass@k=1`, `flake=0`, 25 complete / 4 incomplete, all counter-examples reproduced.\n- `node harness/src/cli.mjs validate --spec ... --no-diff` → valid; `run --dry-run` → pass (both on the workspace and on a clean git fixture containing exactly this change set).\n- `node scripts/check-no-bom.mjs`, `node scripts/check-evidence-refs.mjs`, `node scripts/check-test-coverage-baseline.mjs` → pass.\n- SHA256SUMS recomputed and re-read: 9/9 entries match; credential regex scan over the 12 changed files: 0 hits.\n\n**Not Run**\n- Vitest, ESLint/oxlint and `pnpm run typecheck` are unavailable here (no `node_modules`; installing is out of scope). The new test file was executed through a throwaway local assertion shim (123 assertions passed, shim deleted), and the acceptance JSON records those gates as unverified. Also pre-existing: `check-spec-lifecycle.mjs` fails on `harness-gap-trace-cost-sampling.md` missing `lifecycleStatus` (unrelated to this change, left untouched).\n\nREADMEs were reviewed and intentionally not changed — no user-visible interface, config key, default or product lock moved."}}
